<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Who Wants to Be a Billionaire?</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

    <div class="logo">
        <div class="logo-badge">
            <span class="ring"></span>
            <span>Who Wants to Be a</span>
        </div>
        <h1>Billionaire?</h1>
    </div>

    <section class="rules">
        <h2>How the Game Works</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>15 questions stand between you and <strong>$1,000,000,000</strong>.</li>
            <li>Questions get harder: <strong>5 Easy</strong>, <strong>5 Medium</strong>, <strong>4 Hard</strong>, and the final <strong>Billionaire Question</strong>.</li>
            <li>Each question has <strong>4 options</strong>; only one is correct.</li>
            <li>You have <strong>three 50/50 lifelines</strong>. Each one removes two wrong answers for the current question.</li>
            <li>Reach question <strong>5</strong> and you are guaranteed <strong>$1,000,000</strong>.</li>
            <li>Reach question <strong>10</strong> and you are guaranteed <strong>$32,000,000</strong>.</li>
            <li>Miss a question and you drop down to your last guaranteed amount.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="start-wrap">
        <a href="/quiz" class="button-link">Play</a>
    </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
